ign="top">0.053667585</td><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.029002279</td></tr><tr><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.033809858</td><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.013945703</td><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.033809858</td><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.034012329</td></tr><tr><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.045519624</td><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.04292257</td><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.045519624</td><td align="left" valign="top"/></tr><tr><td align="char" char="." valign="top">0.044439698</td><td align="left" valign="top"/><td align="left" valign="top"/><td align="left" valign="top"/></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><p>The lower panel of Figure 2E has been replaced with the plot generated using the verified TIM-3 expression data and Figure 2—source data 1 has been updated. Although the correction changes the reported TIM-3 expression result for the GDM&amp;PE group, it does not affect the main findings or overall conclusions of the study.</p><p>The article has been corrected accordingly.</p></body></article>